    {
      "id": "claim_95d53f8a5a5b4ac380bb8f31573b02e0",
      "statement": "routes/video.js 以 <script src=\"/assets/artplayer.js\" defer> 外链加载播放器库，并把内联初始化（ASPECT_RATIO/PLAYBACK_RATE 配置与 new Artplayer({...})）包在 window.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", ...) 回调里；defer 保证库脚本在该事件之前执行，因此回调触发时 Artplayer 全局已就绪。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://routes/video.js#L98-L116",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8d0298ed689e2498a9025d1ecd2b280b2107a80db8d81d5c876905b359bce19d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5e9456f7785042a89febe34778ce6c2c",
      "statement": "以 defer（或同为 defer 语义的 type=module）外链加载、又在同一文档里用内联脚本立刻调用的库，必须把调用包进 DOMContentLoaded：内联脚本在 HTML 解析到它时立即执行，早于任何 defer 脚本，直接在顶层调用会因库全局未定义而抛 ReferenceError。",
      "evidence": [
        {
